  questionText:
  - language: English
    text: What happens to the carboxyl group of an amino acid at pH values above
      7?
  - language: German
    text: "Was passiert mit der Carboxylgruppe einer Aminos\xE4ure bei pH-Werten
      \xFCber 7?"
  answers:
  - texts:
    - language: English
      text: It becomes protonated
    - language: German
      text: Sie wird protoniert
  - texts:
    - language: English
      text: It remains neutral
    - language: German
      text: Sie bleibt neutral
  - texts:
    - language: English
      text: "It forms a carboxylate anion (\u2013COO\u207B)"
    - language: German
      text: "Sie bildet ein Carboxylat-Anion (\u2013COO\u207B)"
  - texts:
    - language: English
      text: "It reacts with water to form CO\u2082"
    - language: German
      text: "Sie reagiert mit Wasser zu CO\u2082"
  correctAnswer: 4
